                ><button class="ilobho76PQfHiRp1q" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iXm1VK83l34FmwtMV"><h3>What does it taste like?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="imYMtGDTVDRbXcX6b">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iFI9NIYgZljGUCavt" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iokEDfKTfR16Xot3r"><p>If you&apos;re used to vapor, Lio may not be as strong as you&apos;d expect at first. Lio can be compared to a herbal tea if vapor was compared to a sticky soda. Not as sweet, and a lot more natural.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iGfn61ZHUTSLXExHR" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iAeGjxxokbDekV1gq" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text itapFNncdqWszHDx6"><h3>What is Lio?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iAdgljFo0rIjCOBfe">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iyuFLiswfVEmncQW8" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iX5eKddrfrBRG6Gbk"><p>Lio is a natural habit-breaking device that uses aromatherapy to help you manage cravings without nicotine, chemicals, or harmful additives. It works through olfactory conditioning, the science of how scent influences your brain and behavior.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="i3E8unHPFYKLiGRQ4" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iof1qQjZkYhp0n0l0" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text isMezGZB3ky8VoeLB"><h3>How does Lio work?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ijdWUIycg810LAoQN">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="i7rN031GBuk6GikwJ" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iKimlpTax5VWyYIVi"><p>Stopping a bad habit cold turkey is extremely hard on your brain. Lio helps by replacing your hand-to-mouth fixation, encouraging calming breaths that reduce stress, activating scent receptors that interrupt habit pathways, and providing immediate sensory satisfaction with natural aromatherapy. You&apos;re breathing nothing but clean air infused with natural plant aromatics, no nicotine, no chemicals, no vapor.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iSRawCiU0p4A9B7v7" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="isMSzOlpzTj720OoQ" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ihYQpkrqxcKzwnSnr"><h3>How can something with no nicotine actually work?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iA8fgtMxQJB52honH">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iZ54IQjsJotdDlaPf" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text igonb0EZDeGsaT99M"><p>Here&apos;s what most people don&apos;t know: addiction isn&apos;t just about the chemical substance. Science shows it&apos;s ritual plus chemical. The hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breathing, the sensory triggers, these behavioral patterns create 50-70% of the addiction. Lio targets this ritual component. Your brain doesn&apos;t just crave the substance, it craves the entire experience. That&apos;s why customers say it "works like magic" even without nicotine.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iMBymx7saUt8f5kio" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iDTM96Fyephc2Rvln" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIcyB9y4qxHpU2Pmj"><h3>This looks like another wellness gimmick. Is it really different?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ilHzM8asvmPk9jAAe">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="ifxgmQ5linfYlzlTs" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iMgxQZM2TzTl1KH5T"><p>Lio isn&apos;t based on Instagram trends. It&apos;s grounded in established research on olfactory conditioning and behavioral psychology. We use pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from IFRA-certified EU farms, have multiple 3rd party toxicology reports, and have helped 100,000+ customers across 50+ countries achieve real results. Our devices are produced in the Netherlands with medical-grade materials. This is a clinical tool based on sensory science, not a lifestyle accessory.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="ib3e1nDSYkXsHDBVM" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iotEfcIJad5FFyduM" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ilcyWMCSN9xva7Y12"><h3>Will this actually satisfy my cravings?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iaEF4CzYXsPJH3PBf">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="i83LPrJjM8mJbLrQn" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text itGjnKq2w7bpdbrTZ"><p>Yes. Lio mimics the physical sensations you&apos;re craving: the throat hit from menthol blends, the hand-to-mouth ritual, the stress relief from deep breathing, and the immediate sensory reward. You&apos;re not white-knuckling through cravings, you&apos;re satisfying them in a healthier way. As one customer said: "It gives the throat feeling like a cig without the harm."</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iUYL8DYeQMQQlqxEz" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iOzQStdEfjaLmzbjz" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ib00BjenjDx5q48oh"><h3>Will it work for my specific habit?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="isn4E4vdVasJFkTDG">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iwld3HcE0ADNo2PDU" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ifM3jziu46QHiXC3D"><p>Lio works for any behavior driven by ritual and sensory triggers: chain smoking, vaping, electric shisha, sugar cravings, nail biting, and any repetitive hand-to-mouth behavior. The common thread isn&apos;t the substance, it&apos;s the pattern. If your habit involves repetitive motion and immediate gratification, Lio&apos;s sensory replacement approach will work.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><div class="isXQJjImFxbMxbjOj" data-instant-type="tabs-pane" id="sXQJjImFxbMxbjOj"
            ><div class="in9eIT43OA4Mqjiwt" data-instant-type="accordion-container" data-is-first-open="true" data-is-multi-open-enabled="false"
              ><div data-state="open" class="ijUCDssATEpxoYeW1" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
