                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iB2fKalpwFp4x4B2n"><h3>Is Lio safe?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iQljkBrrElDSHiffj">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="i1vZOxxiZtIt5ydC8" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iT2Xd4j9hddyir45Y"><p>Yes. Multiple 3rd party toxicology reports and studies have been done on the inhalation and digestion of the plant compounds we use. We&apos;re committed to funding ongoing research. BreatheLio is the healthiest, most natural habit-breaking method available.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="igNzWWgWlwVWIXGsy" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="i1VMgyZVJYzFieu79" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i6Hbzvbg1rJtD9JWO"><h3>What are Flavour Cores made of?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iKVtLspaz8dxB9yCs">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iIB2ExYtL8XK9iAjh" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i1qdXCgWiLDAzhqxb"><p>Each Core is made from medical-grade polyester fiber infused with 100% organic natural essential oils from IFRA-certified EU farms. We use pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from certified manufacturers and natural plant extracts like peppermint, black pepper, cinnamon, and botanical aromas. Everything is blended in our Netherlands laboratory where we combine science and aromatherapy to create sophisticated, natural formulations.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iGAoC70yinlrnJGBv" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iCCWO2oqoRJsZeetA" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text im6XSvBIVcEtoX7SB"><h3>Does Lio contain nicotine?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iiFKWss6gaicI7TtD">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iIMRV6kvigxB8vU5F" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ii5fWJMTvxi16R5eE"><p>No. Lio is 100% nicotine-free. You&apos;re breathing pure air with natural aromatics while satisfying the behavioral patterns that make change so difficult.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iL9GORFt6Jq771jb8" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="i1ZISI9l1Gjh0c2tv" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iF4nIXI08oeBmDOEg"><h3>Is Lio vegan and allergen-free?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="izLiKo2F51n0pbXqh">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iav4750hMnD7prxwU" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iPCtTNylEtdJ22lO2"><p>Yes! Every aroma is 100% natural, vegan, and allergen-free. Safe to use anywhere, anytime, even after you&apos;ve brushed your teeth.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div data-state="closed" class="iK02NqcGwJsL0TnwE" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
                ><button class="iyuqWxqh9JHL4517e" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ixcHThYOuBOoyWkI9"><h3>Where do your ingredients come from?</h3></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iqQfE507xV6uvB0Js">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>caret-down</title><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path>
                    </svg></div></button
                ><div class="iF3zZ0SCnd9y8HzSt" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipAcgHwFAbHaXIOB3"><p>All ingredients come from European IFRA-certified farms. Our pharmaceutical-grade aromatics are produced by certified manufacturers within the EU, extracted from natural ingredients only.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><div class="i8pTGvdeGJnCa95Hv" data-instant-type="tabs-pane" id="8pTGvdeGJnCa95Hv"
